#: ../../../how-to/configure-hardware-backed-disk-encryption.md:194
msgid "What to do if you don’t have a recovery key"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/configure-hardware-backed-disk-encryption.md:196
msgid ""
"Your computer might be asking for a recovery key but you don’t have one."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/configure-hardware-backed-disk-encryption.md:198
msgid ""
"If you're logged into your Ubuntu user account, you can retrieve or reset "
"your recovery key. See {ref}`tpm-fde-get-a-new-recovery-key`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/configure-hardware-backed-disk-encryption.md:200
msgid ""
"If your computer is asking for your recovery key during startup, try undoing "
