msgid "Try to log in again."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/configure-hardware-backed-disk-encryption.md:207
msgid ""
"You can also check if the recovery key was automatically stored in the cloud:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/configure-hardware-backed-disk-encryption.md:209
msgid ""
"If your system is managed via Landscape, contact your Landscape "
"administrator for your recovery key."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/configure-hardware-backed-disk-encryption.md:210
msgid ""
"Recovery keys for the Windows BitLocker encryption may be stored on your "
